rtk (Rust Token Killer)
https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk, tag v1.1.0
Copyright 2026 RTK AI Labs
- crates/shodh-rag/src/harness/compress/mod.rs takes these ideas from rtk's
  Apache-2.0 code, and only these: filtering a command's output by the
  program that ran, dropping that program's success lines while keeping its
  failures (src/cmds/rust/cargo_cmd.rs, src/cmds/python/pytest_cmd.rs,
  src/cmds/js/vitest_cmd.rs, src/cmds/go/go_cmd.rs); grouping grep matches
  under their file (src/cmds/system/pipe_cmd.rs); and returning the output
  unchanged when filtering would not shorten it (src/core/guard.rs). The
  code is Shodh's own; no rtk source is copied. rtk's compression engine
  (engine/, rtk-engine) is under the Business Source License 1.1, not
  Apache-2.0; nothing of it is used. rtk ships no NOTICE file.

